00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.170
That means I get to
talk to a lot of data

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:16.540
engineers across the world,
both users of Cloud Pub/Sub

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:19.440
and Kafka, and things like
Dataflow and BigQuery.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:24.710
So we'll-- today's session will
be about using those tools.

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:27.720
Now there are a
couple things that

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:31.600
are interesting about Kir--
that is, me-- in this context.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:35.490
One is, as I said, I get to
work on Cloud Pub/Sub, which

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:38.850
