service, that we try to run

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:41.790
with very good availability.

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:45.780
And we've learned a few things
about using real time streaming

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:47.710
data to help us do that.

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:49.350
So I will share some
of that experience

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:51.270
