be videos and slides.

00:39:14.730 --> 00:39:19.050
Slides, I'm pretty sure, are
posted after the conference.

00:39:19.050 --> 00:39:23.640
So in particular, I would
to highlight the Thursday

00:39:23.640 --> 00:39:26.430
