what's happening there.

00:39:33.670 --> 00:39:37.100
It's going to be a
reasonably deep session.

00:39:37.100 --> 00:39:42.420
And 2:35 on Thursday, GCP
for Apache Kafka users

00:39:42.420 --> 00:39:45.720
